Implementing network security includes configuring network security technologies, securing network design elements, implementing secure networking protocols and services, and securing wireless traffic.
Network components are device, media, network adapter, network operating system, and protocol.
A router is a device that connects multiple networks that use the same protocol. Access control list is a list of rules for blocking or allowing traffic.
